# Mẫu cho một runtime WebLens duy nhất. Copy thành .env khi chạy cục bộ và thay
# toàn bộ secret; production thật phải inject secret từ secret manager.
COMPOSE_PROJECT_NAME=weblens
WEBLENS_POSTGRES_VOLUME=weblens-postgres-data
WEBLENS_CRAWLER_POSTGRES_VOLUME=weblens-crawler-postgres-data
WEBLENS_CLICKHOUSE_VOLUME=weblens-clickhouse-data

POSTGRES_DB=weblens
POSTGRES_USER=weblens
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=replace-with-a-local-only-password
POSTGRES_PORT=55432

# Crawler sở hữu database PostgreSQL riêng; không dùng credential của Control Plane.
CRAWLER_POSTGRES_DB=weblens_crawler
CRAWLER_POSTGRES_USER=weblens_crawler
CRAWLER_POSTGRES_PASSWORD=replace-with-a-crawler-local-only-password
CRAWLER_POSTGRES_PORT=55433
CAPTURE_POSTGRES_DB=weblens_capture
CAPTURE_POSTGRES_USER=weblens_capture
CAPTURE_POSTGRES_PASSWORD=weblens-capture-local-only
CAPTURE_POSTGRES_PORT=55434
CAPTURE_RECONSTRUCTION_GC_POLL_MS=30000
CRAWLER_POSTGRES_URL=postgres://weblens_crawler:replace-with-a-crawler-local-only-password@localhost:55433/weblens_crawler?sslmode=disable

# ClickHouse local dành cho crawl analytics. Production phải dùng network private,
# TLS, role riêng và credential từ secret manager.
CLICKHOUSE_DB=weblens_crawl_analytics
CLICKHOUSE_USER=weblens_crawler
CLICKHOUSE_PASSWORD=replace-with-a-clickhouse-local-only-password
CLICKHOUSE_HTTP_PORT=18123
CLICKHOUSE_NATIVE_PORT=19000
CLICKHOUSE_CAPTURE_DATABASE=weblens_capture_analytics
MINIO_ROOT_USER=weblens_minio
MINIO_ROOT_PASSWORD=weblens-minio-local-only
MINIO_API_PORT=19001
MINIO_CONSOLE_PORT=19002
S3_CAPTURE_BUCKET=weblens-captures
CAPTURE_WORKER_PORT=8082
CAPTURE_CONCURRENCY=2
CAPTURE_BROWSER_HEADLESS=true
# Camoufox is the default. Set playwright explicitly only when testing Chromium.
CAPTURE_BROWSER_ENGINE=camoufox
CAPTURE_BROWSER_STEALTH=false
CAPTURE_SITE_CLONE_CONCURRENCY=2
CAPTURE_MIGRATE_CLICKHOUSE_ON_START=true
WEBLENS_CAPTURE_COMMAND_URL=http://localhost:8082/internal/v1/commands/captures
WEBLENS_SITE_CLONE_COMMAND_URL=http://localhost:8082/internal/v1/commands/site-clones
WEBLENS_CAPTURE_REPORT_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8082
CRAWLER_CLICKHOUSE_ADDR=localhost:19000
CRAWLER_CLICKHOUSE_DATABASE=weblens_crawl_analytics
CRAWLER_CLICKHOUSE_USERNAME=weblens_crawler
CRAWLER_CLICKHOUSE_PASSWORD=replace-with-a-clickhouse-local-only-password
CRAWLER_CLICKHOUSE_SECURE=false

# Kết nối PostgreSQL của Control Plane. URL luôn tường minh để không suy ra
# database từ website đích.
DB_URL=jdbc:postgresql://localhost:55432/weblens
DB_USERNAME=weblens
DB_PASSWORD=replace-with-a-local-only-password

# Generate at least 32 random bytes and Base64-encode them. Never reuse this
# example value in a hosted environment.
WEBLENS_JWT_SECRET=replace-with-a-base64-encoded-256-bit-secret
WEBLENS_COOKIE_SECURE=false
WEBLENS_OPENAPI_ENABLED=true
WEBLENS_CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://127.0.0.1:5173

# Cấu hình capacity production mặc định. Đây là trần hữu hạn có thể chỉnh bằng
# biến môi trường; phải benchmark trên phần cứng triển khai trước khi công bố SLO.
WEBLENS_SCAN_MAX_PAGES=100000
WEBLENS_SCAN_MAX_DEPTH=4
WEBLENS_SCAN_MAX_DURATION_SECONDS=86400
WEBLENS_SCAN_CONCURRENCY=10000
WEBLENS_SITE_CLONE_MAX_PAGES=100000
WEBLENS_SITE_CLONE_MAX_INPUT_BYTES=214748364800
WEBLENS_SITE_CLONE_MAX_ARCHIVE_BYTES=53687091200
WEBLENS_SITE_CLONE_MAX_SHARD_BYTES=268435456
WEBLENS_SITE_CLONE_PAGE_CONCURRENCY=4
WEBLENS_SITE_CLONE_MAX_RETRIES_PER_PAGE=3
WEBLENS_SITE_CLONE_MAX_DURATION_SECONDS=604800
WEBLENS_SITE_CLONE_ARCHIVE_RETENTION_DAYS=7
WEBLENS_SITE_CLONE_METADATA_RETENTION_DAYS=30
WEBLENS_HIKARI_MAX_POOL_SIZE=64
WEBLENS_HIKARI_MIN_IDLE=16
WEBLENS_TOMCAT_MAX_CONNECTIONS=100000
WEBLENS_TOMCAT_ACCEPT_COUNT=20000
WEBLENS_TOMCAT_MAX_THREADS=512
WEBLENS_TOMCAT_MIN_SPARE_THREADS=32

# Tạo một token ngẫu nhiên tối thiểu 32 byte và dùng cùng giá trị cho hai process.
# Đây là secret service-to-service, không phải JWT của người dùng.
WEBLENS_SERVICE_TOKEN=replace-with-at-least-32-random-bytes
WEBLENS_CRAWLER_COMMAND_URL=http://localhost:8081/internal/v1/commands/scans
WEBLENS_CRAWLER_REPORT_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8081
CRAWLER_SERVICE_TOKEN=replace-with-at-least-32-random-bytes
CRAWLER_CONTROL_EVENTS_URL=http://localhost:8080/internal/v1/events/scans
CRAWLER_HTTP_ADDRESS=:8081
CRAWLER_MIGRATE_ON_START=true
CRAWLER_WORKER_CONCURRENCY=10000
CRAWLER_HOST_CONCURRENCY=2
CRAWLER_HOST_DELAY=1s
CRAWLER_LOCAL_TARGETS_ONLY=false
CRAWLER_ANALYTICS_BACKPRESSURE_AGE=15m

# No LLM provider is selected during bootstrap.
# Future provider credentials belong in .env or a secret manager, never source control.
